1
00:00:15,427 --> 00:00:17,207
HA JUNG-WOO

2
00:00:17,434 --> 00:00:19,427
IM SOO-JUNG

3
00:00:22,893 --> 00:00:25,017
KIM JUN-HAN

4
00:00:25,611 --> 00:00:27,191
KRYSTAL JUNG

5
00:00:33,839 --> 00:00:35,522
SHIM EUN-KYUNG

6
00:00:54,705 --> 00:00:59,005
MAD CONCRETE DREAMS

7
00:00:59,195 --> 00:01:01,880
10 DAYS AGO

8
00:01:01,881 --> 00:01:05,005
Congratulations on your birthday,
Ms. Jeon Yang-ja

9
00:01:21,771 --> 00:01:22,638
Oh!

10
00:01:26,005 --> 00:01:26,770
I love it!

11
00:01:26,771 --> 00:01:28,538
Look!

12
00:01:38,838 --> 00:01:40,871
Your mom's tastes
haven't changed.

13
00:01:41,305 --> 00:01:42,405
She's switched it up a bit.

14
00:01:43,091 --> 00:01:45,357
These days, she's into defined
more than bulk.

15
00:01:46,838 --> 00:01:48,337
Defined?

16
00:01:48,338 --> 00:01:49,338
Definition.

17
00:01:52,005 --> 00:01:52,905
Clarity.

18
00:01:53,397 --> 00:01:54,297
You don't know?

19
00:01:56,337 --> 00:01:58,004
Well, anyway, just give the gift.

20
00:02:02,003 --> 00:02:03,236
She'll like this, right?

21
00:02:03,237 --> 00:02:04,870
As if there's anything
that my mom likes.

22
00:02:10,511 --> 00:02:11,411
Still,

23
00:02:12,671 --> 00:02:13,738
how should I comment?

24
00:02:14,905 --> 00:02:16,537
Just give it to her.

25
00:02:16,538 --> 00:02:18,038
You bought it with my money anyway.

26
00:02:19,938 --> 00:02:20,770
But what is it?

27
00:02:20,771 --> 00:02:22,104
Isn't this

28
00:02:22,105 --> 00:02:23,171
too small?

29
00:02:25,131 --> 00:02:26,998
To use when signing contracts.

30
00:02:29,051 --> 00:02:30,051
A fountain pen.

31
00:02:31,698 --> 00:02:33,264
Her initials are engraved here.

32
00:02:33,678 --> 00:02:34,678
It's studded with diamonds.

33
00:02:36,105 --> 00:02:36,905
Made in Germany.

34
00:02:38,471 --> 00:02:39,305
Oh!

35
00:02:47,836 --> 00:02:48,635
Mother.

36
00:02:48,636 --> 00:02:49,403
Yes?

37
00:02:49,770 --> 00:02:50,970
Happy 70th birthday!

38
00:02:51,303 --> 00:02:52,469
Oh, thanks.

39
00:02:52,470 --> 00:02:53,802
I prepared this

40
00:02:53,803 --> 00:02:55,847
thinking a lot about you.

41
00:02:56,103 --> 00:02:57,769
It's for you to use for signing.

42
00:02:57,770 --> 00:02:59,470
Ma'am, you have a visitor.

43
00:03:28,403 --> 00:03:29,270
You’re here?

44
00:03:30,736 --> 00:03:32,035
How are you?

45
00:03:32,036 --> 00:03:32,770
Here, take this.

46
00:03:34,136 --> 00:03:35,403
- Oh.
- Where's my money?

47
00:03:37,202 --> 00:03:38,888
I also have some muscles.

48
00:03:39,170 --> 00:03:40,636
If I take it off, will you pay me?

49
00:03:43,103 --> 00:03:44,702
But it's not quite defined.

50
00:03:44,703 --> 00:03:46,070
So?

51
00:03:47,225 --> 00:03:48,302
Got it.

52
00:03:48,303 --> 00:03:49,369
Let's talk outside.

53
00:03:49,370 --> 00:03:51,369
- Ms. Jeon!
- What are you doing?

54
00:03:51,370 --> 00:03:53,969
- Why my mother-in-law?
- What's wrong?

55
00:03:53,970 --> 00:03:55,536
- Huh?
- I should ask for the money directly.

56
00:03:56,370 --> 00:03:58,084
I'm talking about the only son-in-law

57
00:03:58,803 --> 00:04:00,103
possibly losing a body part.

58
00:04:00,874 --> 00:04:01,869
I told you,

59
00:04:01,870 --> 00:04:04,105
to wait
just a little more, didn't I?

60
00:04:05,136 --> 00:04:07,736
Coming here and doing this is rude.

61
00:04:08,236 --> 00:04:09,236
Rude?

62
00:04:09,403 --> 00:04:10,403
Then...

63
00:04:13,736 --> 00:04:14,435
Hey.

64
00:04:14,436 --> 00:04:15,236
Wait.

65
00:04:15,603 --> 00:04:16,369
That hurts.

66
00:04:16,370 --> 00:04:17,570
- Yes.
- Okay,

67
00:04:18,862 --> 00:04:20,302
I'll give it to you.

68
00:04:20,303 --> 00:04:21,436
In a week?

69
00:04:21,970 --> 00:04:24,303
Tell your mother-in-law, you punk.

70
00:04:25,570 --> 00:04:27,203
Or I'll let her know myself.

71
00:04:57,636 --> 00:04:58,435
Good job.

72
00:04:58,436 --> 00:04:59,470
- Was it okay?
- Yes.

73
00:05:01,136 --> 00:05:02,170
Give me two.

74
00:05:31,903 --> 00:05:33,003
Damn it.

75
00:06:19,736 --> 00:06:22,536
MAD CONCRETE DREAMS

76
00:06:27,536 --> 00:06:29,270
EPISODE 2

77
00:06:33,236 --> 00:06:33,702
A notice regarding Gi Su-jong's debt
and the Seyoon Building auction

78
00:06:33,703 --> 00:06:34,269
has been sent to the address

79
00:06:34,270 --> 00:06:34,802
We appreciate your cooperation
as there may be disadvantages

80
00:06:34,803 --> 00:06:35,403
due to auction or seizure of assets,
so please take note

81
00:06:35,829 --> 00:06:38,763
You may now say
your final goodbyes to the deceased.

82
00:06:44,403 --> 00:06:45,536
Let's proceed.

83
00:07:10,836 --> 00:07:12,102
Hey.

84
00:07:12,103 --> 00:07:13,170
What are you doing?

85
00:07:14,729 --> 00:07:15,695
Hey,

86
00:07:16,670 --> 00:07:18,436
didn't you say you were
at the funeral home all night?

87
00:07:19,370 --> 00:07:20,402
Yeah.

88
00:07:20,403 --> 00:07:22,502
Well, I just came to get something.

89
00:07:23,403 --> 00:07:24,602
Is that so?

90
00:07:24,603 --> 00:07:25,570
Take it with you.

91
00:07:28,903 --> 00:07:29,709
Huh?

92
00:07:33,103 --> 00:07:36,035
Isn't that Yi-gyeong?

93
00:07:36,036 --> 00:07:36,861
What's going on?

94
00:07:36,862 --> 00:07:37,895
Why is she like that?

95
00:07:41,703 --> 00:07:42,936
I kidnapped her.

96
00:07:43,503 --> 00:07:45,202
What

97
00:07:45,203 --> 00:07:46,236
do you mean?

98
00:07:48,036 --> 00:07:49,434
I kidnapped her.

99
00:08:04,336 --> 00:08:06,270
So how much have you lost?

100
00:08:08,429 --> 00:08:09,395
What does it matter?

101
00:08:10,703 --> 00:08:11,570
Can you handle it?

102
00:08:12,936 --> 00:08:14,303
Hey, are you out of your mind?

103
00:08:14,976 --> 00:08:16,895
What have you done?

104
00:08:17,403 --> 00:08:19,602
It's not too late,
so hurry and take her back.

105
00:08:19,603 --> 00:08:21,470
I'll get you a taxi, okay?

106
00:08:21,870 --> 00:08:23,469
If anyone asks,

107
00:08:23,470 --> 00:08:25,735
just say you saved her
from being kidnapped.

108
00:08:25,736 --> 00:08:26,936
Are you crazy?

109
00:08:27,236 --> 00:08:28,270
Save who?

110
00:08:28,836 --> 00:08:29,870
Am I Tom Cruise?

111
00:08:32,136 --> 00:08:33,270
Hey, listen to me.

112
00:08:34,762 --> 00:08:36,395
I'm not joking here.

113
00:08:38,936 --> 00:08:40,170
This is the last chance.

114
00:08:42,629 --> 00:08:44,129
What last chance?

115
00:08:45,036 --> 00:08:47,003
How long do you plan
to keep getting disrespected?

116
00:08:50,203 --> 00:08:51,803
ONE BILLION

117
00:08:53,436 --> 00:08:54,536
I'll let you in on it.

118
00:08:56,303 --> 00:08:57,303
For 500 million.

119
00:09:05,770 --> 00:09:06,803
No.

120
00:09:07,870 --> 00:09:11,002
Hwal-sung,
I'll contact Gyun's juniors.

121
00:09:11,003 --> 00:09:13,435
Let's discuss with them legally.

122
00:09:13,436 --> 00:09:14,370
Su-jong.

123
00:09:16,036 --> 00:09:17,136
Su-jong.

124
00:09:18,070 --> 00:09:20,203
It's not what you think.

125
00:09:21,770 --> 00:09:24,535
I'm just getting
my inheritance money early.

126
00:09:24,536 --> 00:09:26,903
As long as I get the money,
no one gets hurt.

127
00:09:27,203 --> 00:09:29,770
There's no need to feel guilty
about anything, seriously.

128
00:09:30,470 --> 00:09:31,202
- Hey.
- Damn it.

129
00:09:31,203 --> 00:09:32,369
You're just wasting time.

130
00:09:32,370 --> 00:09:33,784
Hey, give me the phone.

131
00:09:34,762 --> 00:09:35,831
- I don't want to.
- Hurry up and give it.

132
00:09:36,103 --> 00:09:37,135
Give it here.

133
00:09:37,136 --> 00:09:39,170
Hey, just give it!

134
00:09:39,436 --> 00:09:41,702
I don't want to!

135
00:09:41,703 --> 00:09:42,536
Come on!

136
00:09:43,003 --> 00:09:43,636
Jeez!

137
00:09:48,036 --> 00:09:49,269
Hey, you punk!

138
00:09:49,270 --> 00:09:50,270
- Seriously!
- Let go!

139
00:09:50,736 --> 00:09:52,936
Let go! Seriously!

140
00:10:00,236 --> 00:10:01,436
Hey, are you okay?

141
00:10:02,503 --> 00:10:03,400
What's this?

142
00:10:07,836 --> 00:10:09,735
I told you to
give me back my phone.

143
00:10:09,736 --> 00:10:11,870
Just take the phone, damn it.

144
00:10:12,370 --> 00:10:13,384
Do whatever you want.

145
00:10:14,362 --> 00:10:16,795
Just live your life
being chased by debt, okay?

146
00:10:17,635 --> 00:10:19,546
Hey, why are you talking like that?

147
00:10:20,529 --> 00:10:22,196
Crazy bastard, you sure are strong.

148
00:10:23,703 --> 00:10:25,369
What are we going to do about this?

149
00:10:25,370 --> 00:10:27,618
Hurry and clean the wound
and disinfect it.

150
00:10:28,603 --> 00:10:29,936
This is really annoying!

151
00:10:31,036 --> 00:10:33,503
I'll take care of the rest.

152
00:10:34,270 --> 00:10:37,102
You just focus on Yi-gyeong
in the cold storage.

153
00:10:37,103 --> 00:10:38,003
Just two days.

154
00:10:38,570 --> 00:10:40,136
Two days...

155
00:10:42,369 --> 00:10:43,825
So, your job

156
00:10:44,836 --> 00:10:45,736
is this.

157
00:10:48,003 --> 00:10:49,170
Three times a day,

158
00:10:49,556 --> 00:10:50,956
you have to give her these shots.

159
00:10:54,723 --> 00:10:56,523
But will Yi-gyeong be okay?

160
00:10:56,970 --> 00:10:57,903
Hey.

161
00:10:59,270 --> 00:11:00,770
It's safe.

162
00:11:01,736 --> 00:11:03,199
Yi-gyeong is my wife.

163
00:11:14,862 --> 00:11:15,862
Have you made a decision?

164
00:11:21,603 --> 00:11:23,003
This is really safe, right?

165
00:12:09,336 --> 00:12:12,102
Hwal-sung, you punk.

166
00:12:12,103 --> 00:12:13,203
I can't believe all this.

167
00:12:39,802 --> 00:12:40,735
Oh my.

168
00:12:42,470 --> 00:12:43,670
You're cold.

169
00:13:27,030 --> 00:13:28,063
I'm sorry.

170
00:13:47,970 --> 00:13:51,570
DAD, WHERE ARE YOU?

171
00:14:03,636 --> 00:14:05,203
Damn.

172
00:14:08,803 --> 00:14:11,003
FREEZER STORAGE

173
00:14:33,703 --> 00:14:34,603
Oh.

174
00:14:35,870 --> 00:14:38,237
What's going on, Da-rae?

175
00:14:38,238 --> 00:14:39,723
There's so much dust in there.

176
00:14:41,436 --> 00:14:44,470
Mom's not feeling well.

177
00:14:45,603 --> 00:14:47,036
Oh, really?

178
00:14:49,470 --> 00:14:50,770
Let's go home.

179
00:15:31,536 --> 00:15:33,170
Mom, eat something.

180
00:15:33,670 --> 00:15:40,136
Dad got this from your favorite
porridge place in Buam-dong.

181
00:16:15,536 --> 00:16:16,470
Gi Da-rae,

182
00:16:17,196 --> 00:16:18,096
I can see you.

183
00:16:23,703 --> 00:16:25,036
Don't you have anything to say?

184
00:16:32,822 --> 00:16:33,722
I'm sorry.

185
00:16:35,003 --> 00:16:35,998
Is that all?

186
00:16:37,870 --> 00:16:39,213
I'll do better from now on.

187
00:16:40,370 --> 00:16:41,979
That's not it.

188
00:16:43,923 --> 00:16:46,260
Don't you think you've been
acting a bit strange lately?

189
00:16:47,190 --> 00:16:49,500
You and Gyun were like brothers.

190
00:16:50,103 --> 00:16:52,734
But at the funeral,
you didn't shed a single tear.

191
00:16:53,440 --> 00:16:54,735
Even during the procession,

192
00:16:54,736 --> 00:16:57,170
you just kept your mind elsewhere,
staring at your phone.

193
00:16:57,636 --> 00:17:00,550
And after the cremation, you just
disappeared like someone running away.

194
00:17:01,236 --> 00:17:02,803
Isn't that a bit much?

195
00:17:04,603 --> 00:17:05,878
Aren't you sad at all?

196
00:17:06,723 --> 00:17:07,685
Gyun is...

197
00:17:11,703 --> 00:17:13,303
Gyun died.

198
00:17:19,370 --> 00:17:21,729
I know you're worried about the building,

199
00:17:22,736 --> 00:17:24,502
but what's most important?

200
00:17:24,503 --> 00:17:25,770
It's family.

201
00:17:26,603 --> 00:17:28,070
You need to protect us

202
00:17:28,270 --> 00:17:30,267
and be there when we need you.

203
00:18:13,236 --> 00:18:14,336
Here.

204
00:18:20,936 --> 00:18:22,736
What a mess this is.

205
00:18:23,936 --> 00:18:25,536
Hurry and change your clothes.

206
00:18:28,103 --> 00:18:29,370
Thank you.

207
00:18:31,870 --> 00:18:32,903
Thank you.

208
00:18:41,903 --> 00:18:45,422
Seeing you've been checking out
the area, you really what's been trending.

209
00:18:45,783 --> 00:18:46,808
You know about that cafe, right?

210
00:18:47,170 --> 00:18:48,535
It's the hottest spot in our neighborhood.

211
00:18:48,536 --> 00:18:49,435
Hello.

212
00:18:49,436 --> 00:18:51,036
- Mr. Oh!
- Yes.

213
00:18:51,336 --> 00:18:53,169
First, let's check
the vacant second floor,

214
00:18:53,170 --> 00:18:54,629
then we'll look at the basement storage.

215
00:18:54,903 --> 00:18:56,902
You said you needed to use
the freezer storage, right?

216
00:18:56,903 --> 00:18:58,070
Yes, that would be great.

217
00:19:03,436 --> 00:19:06,570
I'll get the boiled pork
and you can order the tofu kimchi.

218
00:19:11,103 --> 00:19:12,270
REALTOR HEE-JU

219
00:19:14,422 --> 00:19:15,922
This place is just the same.

220
00:19:16,903 --> 00:19:18,703
Gyun really liked it here.

221
00:19:19,203 --> 00:19:20,503
I know, right?

222
00:19:20,936 --> 00:19:22,669
Your brother really loved the boiled pork.

223
00:19:22,670 --> 00:19:23,903
He would always order soju too.

224
00:19:24,703 --> 00:19:26,469
Well, our landlord

225
00:19:26,470 --> 00:19:28,335
isn't picking up the phone right now.

226
00:19:28,336 --> 00:19:30,170
Shall we check the second floor first?

227
00:19:36,303 --> 00:19:38,069
What about Da-rae's funds

228
00:19:38,070 --> 00:19:39,136
for studying abroad?

229
00:19:39,770 --> 00:19:41,402
I had to put out an urgent fire.

230
00:19:41,403 --> 00:19:42,603
I'll fill it up soon.

231
00:19:45,203 --> 00:19:47,535
Dad,
you went too far this time.

232
00:19:47,536 --> 00:19:48,802
I'm sorry, Da-rae.

233
00:19:48,803 --> 00:19:50,670
I'll pay you back double.

234
00:19:51,269 --> 00:19:52,336
You trust me, right?

235
00:19:54,568 --> 00:19:56,135
From now on,

236
00:19:56,136 --> 00:19:58,770
whatever it is, tell us everything.
I'll help out too.

237
00:19:59,236 --> 00:20:00,503
Of course, I'll do that.

238
00:20:04,970 --> 00:20:06,219
Realtor Hee-ju:
No issues with the freezer storage?

239
00:20:06,220 --> 00:20:07,470
I'M ABOUT TO SHOW THE NEW TENANT

240
00:20:10,036 --> 00:20:11,003
Who is it?

241
00:20:11,903 --> 00:20:13,902
Oh, the realtor.

242
00:20:13,903 --> 00:20:15,970
- That leggings woman?
- Yes.

243
00:20:17,970 --> 00:20:19,236
I don't like her.

244
00:20:20,136 --> 00:20:22,403
Why not? She helps sometimes.

245
00:20:31,303 --> 00:20:32,270
Honey.

246
00:20:33,903 --> 00:20:35,102
Damn it, I'm done for.

247
00:20:35,103 --> 00:20:36,503
Hold on. I need to go to the restroom.

248
00:20:50,836 --> 00:20:52,835
Okay, here it is.

249
00:20:52,836 --> 00:20:53,469
Okay.

250
00:20:53,470 --> 00:20:55,087
Check out the rooftop too.

251
00:20:55,430 --> 00:20:56,661
It's so nice, right?

252
00:20:57,136 --> 00:21:00,503
The vacant second floor is nice
and so is this space too.

253
00:21:01,303 --> 00:21:02,469
If you want,

254
00:21:02,470 --> 00:21:04,369
I'll talk to the owner

255
00:21:04,370 --> 00:21:05,703
and let you use it comfortably.

256
00:21:06,370 --> 00:21:07,769
The phone is currently unable to answer...

257
00:21:07,770 --> 00:21:09,436
Jeez.

258
00:21:33,403 --> 00:21:35,335
This area is popular now,

259
00:21:35,336 --> 00:21:38,061
but once the redevelopment is done,
it'll be crazier.

260
00:21:38,336 --> 00:21:39,670
Is this area
being redeveloped too?

261
00:21:40,703 --> 00:21:42,336
Well, this building
didn't qualify.

262
00:21:42,670 --> 00:21:43,736
That's a relief.

263
00:21:44,203 --> 00:21:46,235
You said the freezer
is in the basement, right?

264
00:21:46,236 --> 00:21:48,203
Yes, just a moment.

265
00:21:50,136 --> 00:21:51,836
INCOMING CALL / SEYOON BUILDING OWNER

266
00:21:55,403 --> 00:21:56,503
SEYOON BUILDING OWNER

267
00:21:57,703 --> 00:21:59,869
The phone
is currently turned off.

268
00:21:59,870 --> 00:22:01,136
Please leave a voicemail...

269
00:22:01,670 --> 00:22:04,035
Since you're here,

270
00:22:04,036 --> 00:22:06,269
want to check out the freezer too?

271
00:22:06,270 --> 00:22:07,503
Sure.

272
00:22:09,470 --> 00:22:10,670
Taxi!

273
00:22:12,070 --> 00:22:13,470
What's with that guy?

274
00:22:14,036 --> 00:22:17,202
Excuse me, but I have an urgent matter.

275
00:22:17,203 --> 00:22:18,602
Can I borrow your phone?

276
00:22:18,603 --> 00:22:20,136
My battery's dead. Please?

277
00:22:20,137 --> 00:22:22,203
- What's with him?
- Please? Just for a moment.

278
00:22:22,204 --> 00:22:23,238
Gosh.

279
00:22:23,239 --> 00:22:25,539
I'll give you
